as you might have noticed the marvel  cinematic universe is big and getting  bigger these days however the sheer  level of talent that's involved in  bringing all those superheroes and  villains on screens both big and small  is even bigger the list of academy award  winners who have either appeared in an  mcu movie or that are set to do so in  the near future is currently comprised  of no less than 26 actors according to  ign that number should give you a rough  idea about the overall caliber of talent  behind the many marvel characters to  grace the silver screen of course there  are still plenty of great actors who  haven't joined the mcu in any capacity  yet and fans are often speculating about  the next big name addition to the  sprawling mega franchise he might not  have an oscar to his name yet but keanu  reeves is one of the biggest names who  tend to come up in such conversations  he's easily one of the biggest action  movie actors who has yet to attach their  names to a marvel studios project which  seems all the more glaring when you  remember that his two most famous roles  neo in the matrix movies and the titular  character of the john wick franchise are  essentially superheroes themselves he  was the one you sent to kill the  pokemon reeves and the mcu seem like a  perfect fit but is there any chance for  this match made in tentpole movie heaven  to ever happen now the actor has finally  weighed in on whether he'd ever join the  marvel cinematic universe in a video  interview with esquire while fielding  questions about roles from throughout  his career reeves had a surprisingly  straightforward answer in response to  esquire asking him outright whether or  not a marvel film role might be in his  future first of all reeves noted that  the word universe is starting to fail to  adequately account for the true scope of  the mcu saying isn't it bigger than a  universe it's almost like a multiverse  it's a marvel verse however he  ultimately didn't dodge the question  about becoming a part of that world  himself saying it would be an honor he  then spoke to the quality of talent  involved behind the scenes of many of  marvel's flagship projects saying  there's some really amazing directors  and visionaries and they're doing  something that no one's really ever done  it's special in that sense in terms of  the scale the ambition the production so  it would be cool to be a part of that  all in all it appears that reeves is at  the very least not yet a part of an mcu  project or if he is he's clearly not at  liberty to share the news with the  public yet nevertheless he appears to be  about as open as an actor could be to  the prospect of joining marvel's  multi-billion dollar franchise meaning  that his eventual mcu debut remains a  distinct enticing possibility people  keep asking if i'm back  and i haven't really had an answer  but now yeah  i'm taken on back  it's fascinating that keanu reeves  actually addressed the mcu rumors and  doubly so because he didn't shoot them  down after all speculation of his  involvement in some upcoming mcu  projects has been running rampant for  years now take the rumor that made the  rounds in march 2020 for example it  suggested that reeves might become the  mcu incarnation of ghost writer the  skull-faced flaming motorcycle rider  might be an interesting choice seeing as  a version of the character has already  made an appearance in the mcu adjacent  agents of shield portrayed by gabriel  luna though reeves would probably  portray the johnny blaise version of the  character which was memorably played by  nicholas cage and the decidedly non-mcu  2007 movie ghost rider and its buckwild  sequel ghost rider spirit of vengeance a  recent looper pole meanwhile determined  that fans want reeves to portray the  superhuman adam warlock that role of  course ultimately went to midsummer star  will poulter but there's plenty of  reason to assume that the rumor mill  will keep turning for quite a while  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movie rumors are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]
 

